  <!-- =========================================================================
       Frequently Asked Questions
       ========================================================================= -->
  <section id="faq" class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="section-tag">Got Questions?</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        <p class="section-desc">Everything you need to know about reciprocal peer-to-peer knowledge swaps.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-container">
        <div class="faq-item open">
          <button class="faq-question">
            <span>Is SkillSwap really 100% free?</span>
            <svg class="faq-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            Yes! SkillSwap operates entirely on the reciprocal currency of knowledge. You teach a peer for 1 hour in exchange for 1 hour of their mentorship. There are no subscription fees, escrow payments, or hidden charges.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question">
            <span>What if our skill levels or experience differ?</span>
            <svg class="faq-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            Skill levels don't have to be identical—only mutual respect and enthusiasm matter! For example, an expert software developer learning beginner guitar is a natural match for a guitarist wanting to learn basic coding. You both agree on expectations before kicking off.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question">
            <span>How do we schedule and conduct our sessions?</span>
            <svg class="faq-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            Once you propose a swap and the member accepts, you coordinate convenient times via Google Meet, Zoom, or Discord. Many partners choose weekly 60-minute calls split 30/30 or alternating teaching roles every week.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question">
            <span>What happens if a swap partner doesn't show up?</span>
            <svg class="faq-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            Our platform features community accountability. Members build a reputation score based on punctuality and verified exchanges. You can cancel any swap at any time with one click from your "My Swaps" drawer.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

